# No Cursor on GitHub

This repo must list only the human owner as a contributor.

- Never add `Co-authored-by: Cursor` or any `cursoragent@cursor.com` trailer.
- Never set author/committer to Cursor.
- If a commit already has that trailer, strip it before pushing (rewrite the message; do not leave it on `main`).
- Prefer `git commit-tree` / a message rewrite over a commit that would re-inject the trailer.
